        },
        {
          "text": " Omu mwaka ogu Tarutaani, owaatumiirwe Sarugooni omugabe wa Asiria, yaiziiremu Ashidoodi, akagirwanisa, akagikwata, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
