            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " nikwo n'omugabe wa Asiria aritwara Abanyamisri bari enkwatwa, n'Abaesiopia bari encuubwa, abato n'abakuru, bakagyenda bajwaire busha, bataine nkaito, ebibunu biri aheeru, kuhemura Misri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
